# slug: ch47-check-certificate
# source: chapters/ch47.tex:277
# label: alg:ch47-check-certificate
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch47.tex:280
# caption: Check a proposed invariant map before trusting its clients.

REQUIRE CFG with exact edge relations T_e, initial predicate Init, proposed predicates I_B
ENSURE certificate accepted only if initialization and every edge preserve it
require Solve(Init AND NOT I_{ENTRY}) to return UNSAT
FORALL edges e=(B,C) DO
  q <- I_B(sigma) AND T_e(sigma,sigma') AND NOT I_C(sigma')
  require Solve(q) to return UNSAT
END FOR
on any SAT, UNKNOWN, unsupported encoding, or resource failure, reject the certificate
RETURN accepted for this CFG and these semantic parameters

